    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What it takes apart",
      "text": [
        "- Manifested Ingot: **2** Bound Echoes.",
        "- Bound Echo: **2** Attuned Echoes.",
        "- Attuned Echo: **2** Echo Shards.",
        "- Resonant Core: **3** Manifested Ingots.",
        "- Spiritweave: **2** wool.",
        "- Damaged Spiritgear: **1** Manifested Ingot.",
        "Fresh, undamaged tools are refused: Spiritgear has to take damage first.",
        "It needs a Loom Resonance Totem within 8 blocks. Missing Loom pauses it, and it spends nothing."
